Short:        Matrix functions for C: BUGFIXED
Author:       daltern@ic.ac.uk (Nick d'Alterio)
Uploader:     daltern ic ac uk (Nick d\\'Alterio)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

A set of functions in C for manipulating matrices. Includes:-

Multiplication
Subtraction
Addition
LU decompositon
Simultaneous equation solution
Inverse
Determinant
Partial Pivoting
Dot Product
Modulus
Inverse Iteration
Operation by a constant
Comparison
Swap Rows

and more

2nd release fixes bugs in MatAdd, MatInv, MatDet
